  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Tunable White COB LED Strip Light"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "As a core component of the White CCT Tunable COB LED Strip Light Combo Kit, this LED light strip offers adjustable white light with a color temperature range from warm white to cool white (2700K-6500K). You can automatically select the appropriate mode based on your own model design. It fulfills your various needs, providing you with more possibilities for your creations."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Illuminate Your Printing Journey"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Experience enhanced visibility of the printing process with the internal illumination provided by this LED light strip. Watch as your models come to life layer by layer, with improved clarity and precision. Perfect for detailed observation and capturing stunning visuals, this lighting solution takes your printing experience to the next level."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Disconnect the power before installation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The product must be cut only along the pre-defined cutting lines to avoid product damage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "An electric soldering iron must be used to solder the wiring head after cutting the product."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product can accept proper bending."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Do not use any voltage other than the voltage marked on the product to access the product."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Avoid luminescent zone colloid contact with high temperature objects, so as not to burn the colloid and affect the linear effect."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Do not bend or twist the lamp strip at a short distance to avoid damage to the rubber strip or damage to the electrical structure of the chip."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Tunable White COB LED Strip Light</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"BBRnd3ZnMoheF1xBZCMcou9xnR4\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\">As a core component of the <span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"../../../products/white-cct-tunable-cob-led-strip-light-combo-kit\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\">White CCT Tunable COB LED Strip Light Combo Kit</a></span>, this LED light strip offers adjustable white light with a color temperature range from warm white to cool white (2700K-6500K). You can automatically select the appropriate mode based on your own model design. It fulfills your various needs, providing you with more possibilities for your creations.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/35853f30676e492fb86fe04653d7e0de.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/35853f30676e492fb86fe04653d7e0de.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0651/1555/4032/files/banner.png?v=1704263648\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Illuminate Your Printing Journey</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"BBRnd3ZnMoheF1xBZCMcou9xnR4\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\">Experience enhanced visibility of the printing process with the internal illumination provided by this LED light strip. Watch as your models come to life layer by layer, with improved clarity and precision. Perfect for detailed observation and capturing stunning visuals, this lighting solution takes your printing experience to the next level.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vx83du4dvo5ChZxT1OBc8e5onog\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vx83du4dvo5ChZxT1OBc8e5onog\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vx83du4dvo5ChZxT1OBc8e5onog\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0651/1555/4032/files/20240103-143120.png?v=1704263648\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0651/1555/4032/files/20240103-143120.png?v=1704263648\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_table-row\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" colspan=\"2\">Product Specification</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Type of Strip</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">COB (chip on board)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">IC type</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">16703</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">LED Model</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">2835</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Led Quantity</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">2160 LEDs (432 LEDs/M)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Length</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">16.4ft/5m</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" colspan=\"2\">Product Specification</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">\n<p>Input Voltage</p>\n<p>Power</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">\n<p>DC24V</p>\n<p>16.3W/m</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">LED Strip Width</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">12 mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Color</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Dual temperature</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Color Temperature</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">2700K-6500K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">FPCB Color</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">White</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" colspan=\"2\">Product Specification</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Operating Temperature</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">-4℉~104℉（-20℃~+40℃ ）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Control Distance</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">20-30M</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Battery Type</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">CR2025</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Cutting Unit</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">16.7 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Waterproof</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">IP 20</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Parameter</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Each pixel can be easily cut or soldered independently without damaging the rest pixels. The LED strip is constructed with a 50cm (1.6FT) Flexible Printed Circuit Board (FPCB), featuring a solder point at every 50cm interval. This design ensures convenient connectivity and easy customization along the strip.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"USB Control\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0651/1555/4032/files/515171ad6fe573c3abca2237c86d7b21.png?v=1704263648\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"USB Control\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0651/1555/4032/files/515171ad6fe573c3abca2237c86d7b21.png?v=1704263648\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Installation</h3>\n</div>\n<br/>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"Installation\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/Group_48464.png?v=1705649179\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"Installation\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/Group_48464.png?v=1705649179\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Light Touch Panel Controller Instructions</h3>\n</div>\n<br/>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"Touch wireless panel two-color temperature water controller\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0651/1555/4032/files/1c759505ee3d0f4d8e13bc25f3c8b409.png?v=1704263648\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"Touch wireless panel two-color temperature water controller\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0651/1555/4032/files/1c759505ee3d0f4d8e13bc25f3c8b409.png?v=1704263648\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Considerations</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Disconnect the power before installation.</li>\n<li>The product must be cut only along the pre-defined cutting lines to avoid product damage.</li>\n<li>An electric soldering iron must be used to solder the wiring head after cutting the product.</li>\n<li>This product can accept proper bending.</li>\n<li>Do not use any voltage other than the voltage marked on the product to access the product.</li>\n<li>Avoid luminescent zone colloid contact with high temperature objects, so as not to burn the colloid and affect the linear effect.</li>\n<li>Do not bend or twist the lamp strip at a short distance to avoid damage to the rubber strip or damage to the electrical structure of the chip.</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "As a core component of the White CCT Tunable COB LED Strip Light Combo Kit, this LED light strip offers adjustable white light with a color temperature range from warm white to cool white (2700K-6500K). You can automatically select the appropriate mode based on your own model design. It fulfills your various needs, providing you with more possibilities for your creations.\n\nExperience enhanced visibility of the printing process with the internal illumination provided by this LED light strip. Watch as your models come to life layer by layer, with improved clarity and precision. Perfect for detailed observation and capturing stunning visuals, this lighting solution takes your printing experience to the next level.\n\nDisconnect the power before installation.\n\nThe product must be cut only along the pre-defined cutting lines to avoid product damage.\n\nAn electric soldering iron must be used to solder the wiring head after cutting the product.\n\nThis product can accept proper bending.\n\nDo not use any voltage other than the voltage marked on the product to access the product.\n\nAvoid luminescent zone colloid contact with high temperature objects, so as not to burn the colloid and affect the linear effect.\n\nDo not bend or twist the lamp strip at a short distance to avoid damage to the rubber strip or damage to the electrical structure of the chip.",
